# Curated Skills

Use the installed skills' own descriptions and invocation policies to select
relevant guidance. Resolve resources from each skill's installed directory.
This bridge does not add triggers or override explicit-only invocation.

See installed SKILL.md files under `.cursor/skills/` (project) or
`~/.cursor/skills/` (user). Canonical source is `skills/<bucket>/<name>/SKILL.md`
in the wujs-curated-skills repository, not necessarily in the current project.
